ons/voids are recomputed, so stored metrics can go stale.","reqId":"REQ-2","rubric":6,"severity":"medium"},{"finding":"Applying the contract's security requirements is never stated to leave '/', '/openapi/v1.json' and '/swagger' anonymous, yet the health test and the factory's product page depend on those routes.","reqId":"REQ-1","rubric":7,"severity":"medium"},{"finding":"The Program.cs lines 8–9 anchor quote contains the redacted placeholder «SECRET_1» and so cannot match the source text exactly (spec-lint already flags this anchor as not matching the code).","reqId":"REQ-2","rubric":5,"severity":"medium"},{"finding":"Seeding 'each application table' independently does not require seeded feeding events, inventory movements and lot feed rollups to agree with each other, although REQ-8 assumes they always do.","reqId":"REQ-3","rubric":6,"severity":"low"},{"finding":"AC-6.1 and AC-6.2 are manual reviews only and give no automatable check at a public surface.","reqId":"REQ-6","rubric":3,"severity":"low"}],"lint":[{"check":"L1 ids","details":"ok","passed":true},{"check":"L2 req-ac","details":"ok","passed":true},{"check":"L3 ears","details":"ok","passed":true},{"check":"L4 vague","details":"ok","passed":true},{"check":"L5 nfr","details":"ok","passed":true},{"check":"L6 scope","details":"ok","passed":true},{"check":"L8 anchors","details":"ok","passed":true},{"check":"L9 size","details":"This spec has 9 requirements, about 2 runs' worth of work for a feature; approve it as one run or reject with which part to cut.","passed":false},{"check":"L10 trace","details":"ok","passed":true},{"check":"L11 observable","details":"ok","passed":true},{"check":"L12 literals","details":"ok","passed":true}],"nfrs":[{"id":"NFR-1","metric":"100% of declared operations pass contract-conformance checks.","text":"Every HTTP method and path declared in the locked OpenAPI contract conforms to its declared request, response, status, and security definitions."},{"id":"NFR-2","metric":"100% of rows 